# Git commits

- Author and committer must always be `dureform <181001745+dureform@users.noreply.github.com>`.
- Never include `Co-authored-by: Cursor` / `cursoragent@cursor.com` (or any Cursor co-author trailer).
- Prefer `git commit-tree` (or equivalent) so Cursor cannot inject co-author trailers.
- Do not use `git commit` in a way that adds Cursor as a contributor on GitHub.
